# MCP integrations

This plugin defines the MCP servers below in `config/plugin.yaml`. Only
the ones with `enabled: true` end up in the generated `.mcp.json` (and
actually connect). The rest are documented here so you can turn them on
whenever it makes sense (e.g. once you have tokens/OAuth sorted out).

To enable a server: in `config/plugin.yaml`, set `enabled: true` on the
relevant `mcp_servers` entry, then run `python generate.py --bump patch`.

