## A note on authorization

- **GitLab MCP** — on first connection, the AI client registers itself as
  an OAuth application on your GitLab instance and receives a token. You
  don't need to paste a Personal Access Token into the config by hand.
- **Atlassian (Jira/Confluence) MCP** — the official remote Atlassian
  server, OAuth 2.1 by default (browser flow on first use). An API token
  is the alternative for unattended setups / Jira Service Management.
